hub_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/764525022","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/8428#issuecomment-764525022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/8428","id":764525022,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc2NDUyNTAyMg==","user":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-21T10:06:50Z","updated_at":"2021-01-21T10:06:50Z","body":"Thanks for reporting. Just after we report the seek position to the IMA SDK we get `CONTENT_RESUME_REQUESTED` then `CONTENT_PAUSE_REQUESTED` for the ad. The problem is that the first `CONTENT_RESUME_REQUESTED` is interpreted as a request to skip the ad by IMA extension, due to the workaround added to skip VPAID ads in #7832. I will revert that workaround and replace it with a more robust workaround where we instead timeout loading an initial VPAID ad, which should fix the regression.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/764525022/reactions","t